---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import CozmcPanel from '../components/CozmcPanel.astro';
import { BRAND, PARENT_SITE_URL } from '../config';
---
<Prose title="About" description="Who makes NerdyBirdie LLC Gaming Guides and how we check what we publish.">
  <img src={BRAND.fullLogo} srcset={`${BRAND.fullLogo} 1x, ${BRAND.fullLogo2x} 2x`} alt="Nerdy Birdie logo: a teal bird in an orange cap and sunglasses holding a tablet, in front of a planet, above the words Nerdy Birdie" width="200" height="200" class="logo" />
  <p>NerdyBirdie LLC Gaming Guides makes free guides and trackers for players, starting with Grand Theft Auto VI. It's built to be checked on a phone
  next to the console: quick answers, no clutter, and no spoilers unless you ask for them.</p>
  {PARENT_SITE_URL && <p>It's a <a href={PARENT_SITE_URL}>NerdyBirdie LLC</a> project. Visit the main site at <a href={PARENT_SITE_URL}>nerdy-birdie.com</a>.</p>}
  <h2>How we check things</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Facts come from official sources first (the publisher, Xbox, PlayStation), then established guide sites and credited creators.</li>
    <li>Every guide entry shows its sources and the date they were last checked, and says whether it's Confirmed, Unconfirmed or a Rumor.</li>
    <li>Map pins come from open community data and are labelled Unconfirmed until we check them. Chance spawns aren't pinned until confirmed.</li>
    <li>We note when something has been tested in-game by us, on which platform.</li>
    <li>Spotted a mistake? See <a href="/corrections/">Corrections</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Free, no sign-up</h2>
  <p>The guides and tracker are free. There's no account, no wallet, and nothing to join. Your progress stays on your device.</p>
  <h2>Unofficial fan guide</h2>
  <p>NerdyBirdie LLC Gaming Guides is independent and unofficial. It is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by Rockstar Games, Take-Two Interactive,
  Microsoft/Xbox or Sony Interactive Entertainment/PlayStation. Grand Theft Auto and all related names are trademarks of their owners and are
  used here only to say which game a guide is about.</p>
  <h2>Map data and credits</h2>
  <p>Map locations and the coastline and road outlines come from <a href="https://github.com/fbritoferreira/gta6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open GTA 6 Map</a>
  (fbritoferreira and contributors), licensed <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>, at a pinned revision.
  We filtered the records, simplified the outlines and drew our own map and pins; no game art, map tiles or screenshots are used.</p>
  <h2>Community</h2>
  <p>NerdyBirdie LLC Gaming Guides is part of the COZMC community. Joining is optional.</p>
</Prose>
<div class="wrap" style="margin-top:28px"><CozmcPanel /></div>
<style> .logo { width: 200px; height: 200px; border-radius: 20px; } </style>
